Source: @MODULE@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PACKAGE@
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         dkms,
         linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: DVB driver modules for @PROFILE@ (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree DVB modules for the @PROFILE@ tuner, taken from the tbsdtv
 linux_media tree and reduced to the handful of drivers this device needs.
 .
 DKMS rebuilds them automatically for every kernel that is installed, so the
 tuner keeps working across kernel updates without manual intervention.
 .
 The tuner firmware is proprietary and is therefore not shipped with this
 package; see /usr/share/doc/@PACKAGE@/README.Debian for how to obtain it.
